/s_ratio_poster/public/p1993326737.webp","tag":"动作,科幻,动画,惊悚,犯罪","address":" 日本","years":"2002","date":"","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2152986981.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2403609225.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2459688570.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2177510601.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2152987732.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1993326737.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2869044512.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1662567331.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1666103230.webp\"]","descs":"《攻壳机动队》动画TV版，分2季。\n　　第一季描述：公元2030年，经历了4次世界大战的世界面临更严峻的挑战。随着人类义体化等科技的不断发展，犯罪行为也日渐离奇复杂。为了解决这类案件，日本内务省的直属部队——公安9课，这个对外不存在的特种部队，在队长草薙素子的带领下向恶势力 发起制裁。而面对公安9课的，是高度发达的科技下创造的案件、权力政治斗争的阴谋、与以笑脸男为代表的Stand Alone Complex犯罪。\n　　第二季故事发生在笑脸男事件结束后，公安9课面对了新的敌人，自称“个人的11人”的反政府武装组织开始了计划周密的犯罪，其背后牵扯的战争难民问题更令整个社会的矛盾激化。面对政府与犯罪分子带来的压力，草薙素子再次带领公安9课出动。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1s0UtXTm-VwROW3W_OrrB9Q?pwd=7q2i\",\"size\":\"5.26\",\"date\":\"2025-06-14\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":41,"title":"楚门的世界 The Truman Show","ratingNum":9.4,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p479682972.webp","tag":"No.10豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 美国","years":"1998","date":"1998-06-05(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p764864325.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2614740719.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2614864522.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1332031501.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2614740691.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p479682972.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2559710521.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1466300172.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2892287039.webp\"]","descs":"楚门（金•凯瑞 Jim Carrey 饰）是一个平凡得不能再平凡的人，除了一些有些稀奇的经历之外——初恋女友突然失踪、溺水身亡的父亲忽然似乎又出现在眼前，他和绝大多数30多岁的美国男人绝无异样。这令他倍感失落。他也曾试过离开自己生活了多年的地方，但总因种种理由而不能成行。\n　　直到有一天，他忽然发觉自己似乎一直在被人跟踪，无论他走到哪里，干什么事情。这种感觉愈来愈强烈。楚门决定不惜一切代价逃离这个他生活了30多年的地方，去寻找他的初恋女友。\n　　但他却发现自己怎样也逃不出去。真相其实很残忍。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1XrnMBodhO7jnxmuMecJv0g?pwd=54re\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-07-27\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":203,"title":"星际穿越 Interstellar","ratingNum":9.4,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2614988097.webp","tag":"No.8豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 美国 / 英国 / 加拿大","years":"2014","date":"2014-11-12(中国大陆)、2020-08-02(中国大陆重映)、2014-11-07(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2208063011.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2211063036.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2563778789.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2563780308.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2234509041.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2614988097.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2206088801.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2233085239.w