,\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1924654578.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1870772842.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2176865108.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1806250025.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1887183554.webp\"]","descs":"2017年，母星遭到毁灭的外星流亡者入侵地球。人类虽然用核武器打败对手，但也付出失去家园的惨痛代价。在接下来将近半个世纪的时光中，人类移民泰坦星（土卫六），不过仍有极少部分人类留在故土，扫荡残存的外星掠夺者。杰克·哈珀（汤姆·克鲁斯 Tom Cruise 饰）与维多利亚（安德丽亚·瑞斯波罗格 Andrea Riseborough 饰）即是留守者中的一员，他们的主要任务为保障遍布各地守护水萃取塔的无人机正常运行。看似永无止境的任务终于接近尾声，而就在此刻，不明飞行器坠落一处无人区。杰克在当地发现数名人类伤员，可是他们却遭到无人机的屠杀。危急时刻，杰克救下了一个名为茱莉亚（欧嘉·柯瑞兰寇 Olga Kurylenko 饰）的女子。\n　　这一事件令杰克无意中知晓了掠夺者以及自身背后隐藏的秘密…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1sDo8q6cHPn4BwAw_4NSY1w?pwd=hk2h\",\"size\":\"1.52\",\"date\":\"2025-08-08\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1244,"title":"地心历险记 Journey to the Center of the Earth","ratingNum":6.9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 80% 动作片\n好于 80% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p453461145.webp","tag":"动作,科幻,冒险","address":" 美国","years":"2008","date":"2008-09-29(中国大陆)、2008-07-11(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p456695395.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p456694197.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p456695306.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p456694119.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2702545711.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p453461145.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2243705955.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2907366156.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2907366152.webp\"]","descs":"虽然特雷弗（布兰登·费舍 Brendan Fraser 饰）是大学的地质教授，但是却经常做出挑战传统的事情。他认为，凡尔纳的小说并不是科幻，而是真是存在的。就是因为这样的对立理论，使其被传为学院里的笑话，使得他的学术名声毁于一旦。不过特雷弗却毫不在意这些，他坚信自己的理 论是正确的。为了验证自己的理论，特雷弗带着侄子肖恩（乔什·哈切森 Josh Hutcherson 饰）和当地的向导汉娜（安妮塔·布瑞姆 Anita Briem 饰）开始了在冰岛的旅行。在旅行时，三人意外发现一个奇特的洞穴，并在探询时踏破薄冰跌入了无底深渊。不过，当他们醒来时，却发现了一个神秘的地心世界，里面有着各种稀奇古怪的生物，与凡尔纳小说里面描述的场景一模一样。证据终于找到了，但是如何将证据带回地上？特雷弗三人开始了寻找出路之旅…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1dZ5-CifZN9SuVceeZrUu6g?pwd=4gs9\",\"size\":\"1.26\",\"date\":\"2025-08-10\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1231,"title":"特种部队2：全面反击 G.I. Joe: Retaliation","ratingNum":6.6,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 77% 动作片\n好于 77% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1811974432.webp","tag":"动作,科幻","address":" 美国","years":"2013","date":"2013-04-15(中国大陆)、2013-03-28(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1916803400.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1916803597.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1916799591.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1916801602.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1916800294.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1811974432.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1543981602.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2549723284.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2549721799.webp\"]","descs":"在公爵（钱宁·塔图姆 Channing Tatum 饰）的率领下，特种部队给恐怖组织“眼镜蛇”以沉重的打击。虽然眼镜蛇指挥官等中心人物落网，但白幽灵（李秉宪 饰）等组织骨干依然逍遥法外，时刻准备向特种部队和全世界展开反扑。在干净利落解决某中东国家的核危机后，特种部队突然遭 到来自美国政府的惨烈打击，公爵等队员英勇殉职，只有拦路虎（道恩·强森 Dwayne Johnson 饰）、杰伊小姐（阿德琳妮·帕里奇 Adrianne Palicki 饰）和弗林（D·J·科特罗纳 D.J. Cotrona 饰）三人侥幸逃生。原来眼镜蛇早已渗透到美国高层，他们藉此抹黑特种部队，栽赃重要成员之一的蛇眼，其目的是为了找出并解救被囚禁的指挥官。\n　　名义上已经“死亡”的拦路虎三人，必须想尽各种办法阻止眼镜蛇的邪恶计划，为死去的战友和特种部队正名…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/11tITTS34yd19thX1-cDu4w?pwd=hk2h\",\"size\":\"1.4\",\"date\":\"2025-08-08\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1242,"title":"哥斯拉-1.0 ゴジラ-1.0","ratingNum":6.5,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 62% 剧情片\n好于 73% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2900227040.webp","tag":"第96届奥斯卡金像奖提名名单","address":" 日本","years":"2023","date":"2023-11-01(东京国际电影节)、2023-11-03(日本)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2897688099.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898089060.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898089136.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2900094728.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898089080.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2900227040.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2900236341.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2898089123.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2900227060.webp\"]","descs":"影片为庆祝哥斯拉诞生70周年的纪念作品，也是东宝第30部哥斯拉大作。故事设定在二战后的日本，哥斯拉的出现仿佛要给已经变得一无所有（归0）的日本再添一击，将这个国家打到负值（负1.0）。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/15ojC3uUyhbSBpnt3SoEfjg?pwd=4gs9\",\"size\":\"2.78\",\"date\":\"2025-08-10\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1213,"title":"掠食城市 Mortal Engines","ratingNum":6.3,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 70% 动作片\n好于 71% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2543972440.webp","tag":"第17届美国视觉效果协会奖获奖名单","address":" 美国 / 新西兰 / 日本","years":"2018","date":"2019-01-18(中国大陆)、2018-12-14(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2508144767.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2511270103.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2565386216.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2508105552.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2524136409.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2545488791.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2541570446.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2528758251.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2549962116.webp\"]","descs":"一次灾难性事件毁灭了文明，数千年后，人类已经适应，并进化出了新的生存方式。如今，巨大的移动城市在地球上漫步，无情地吞噬着小牵引城镇。汤姆·纳茨沃西（罗伯特·席安饰），来自大牵引城市伦敦的低层，在遭遇了危险逃犯海特·肖（海拉·希尔莫饰）后，不得不开始为生存而奋战。两个截然相反，本不该相遇的人，却意外结盟，他们注定将改变未来。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1CvzUFulgGA8N3So4ApiRJw?pwd=6ysq\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-08-07\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1230,"title":"异界 Кома","ratingNum":6.2,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 62% 动作片\n好于 65% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2581658698.webp","tag":"动作,科幻,冒险","address":" 俄罗斯","years":"2020","date":"2020-01-30(俄罗斯)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2526992822.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2542786557.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2542786556.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2573607898.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2526992825.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2581658698.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2577699733.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2613737731.webp\"]","descs":"诡异奇幻的世界，充满了一切不可能。建筑师维克托（林奈·穆罕默托夫 Rinal Muchametow 饰）从沉沉的梦中醒来，仿佛失去了所有的记忆。此时此刻，房屋上下充满了霉变一般的黑斑，而黑斑就像有生命一般，时而扩张，时而退缩。维克托走出房门，来到大街，发现眼前的一切早已脱离了现实，房屋从各个角度耸立，身边的人残缺不全却行走如常。正在此时，一团如沸腾沥青般的怪物细想了他，关键时刻维克托被二男一女救下。事后从对方口中得知，服药过量或者因事故处于濒死状态的人，才会来到这片由同类们的大脑共同构建的潜意识的世界。\n　　为了生存，维克托必须想方设法激发自己潜在的能力…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/14M1ULCF3-Vgn_VYnUzg5HA?pwd=hk2h\",\"size\":\"1.51\",\"date\":\"2025-08-08\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1232,"title":"无限 Infinite","ratingNum":5.5,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 44% 动作片\n好于 50% 科幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2655492682.webp","tag":"动作,科幻,惊悚","address":" 美国","years":"2021","date":"2021-06-10(美国网络)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2658381113.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2657303328.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2657303327.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2659063520.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2659062858.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2652508644.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2655492682.webp\"]","descs":"改编自D. Eric Maikranz所著小说《转世文献》(The Rein carnationist Papers)，聚焦一个被自己前两世的记忆缠绕的男子，引出一群几乎长生不死、几世纪来多次转生的人，被称为“无限/无穷之人”，他们的组织叫“Cognomina”。为了打败想毁灭地球的邪恶力量，他们必须依靠这个精神分裂的男子，而后者先要搞清楚：他常做的奇怪的梦都是前世的记忆。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1dEC3VZY1DX1fIvQBvM-Tuw?pwd=hk2h\",\"size\":\"1.67\",\"date\":\"2025-08-08\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1233,"title":"狐步六号 Foxtrot Six","ratingNum":5.4,"ratingbetterthan":""